          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP552 -  Castle Keep&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This one has a cool name, and the location on the map looks pretty cool as well.  Seems it was an empty lot with an exposed cap right next to the curb, almost the easist one for me today, 6th of 11 for the day.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
