        <groundspeak:log id="683858289">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-03T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="3339080">Gimli*/GeoJoce</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP552 Castle Keep&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Another day, another couple of brass caps.  I got home from work and immediately got my caching clothes on, leashed up the geodog and we were on the hunt! I decided to bring us here so we could walk around the lake after the find.  Thought we could reach the path from here, but not so.  That required a little further drive up the road.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The cap was an easy walk up though.  One of the easiest I've found, in fact.  :)  After I grabbed a couple pics, dog and I checked out the unpassable fence and then hopped in the car to drive up the road to the path.  A full walk around the Lake was in order....it's been a while since I've been here and it was a nice night for the walk.  TFTBC OFTH and for bringing me back here.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
